## Space for the whole crew

The Family Studio is built for families of any size: a double bed for the grown-ups and a bunk bed for the kids, plus a fully equipped kitchenette with a Nespresso machine. The spacious en-suite has a walk-in shower. The perfect spot for a comfortable stay with the people you love.
